  -i, --variable-id <variable-id>  Variable id. If specified, -a is ignored.
  --no-deep                        No deep delete. This leaves orphaned
                                   configuration artifacts behind.
  -h, --help                       Help
  -hh, --help-more                 Help with all options.
  -hhh, --help-all                 Help with all options, environment variables,
                                   and usage examples.

Rule:
  one of -a, --all | -i, --variable-id <variable-id> is required -- choose what to delete

